sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Visitor
  participant Web as Next.js Web
  participant CourseApi as CourseController
  participant CourseService as CourseService
  participant CourseRepo as CourseRepository

  Visitor->>Web: Search or filter courses
  Web->>CourseApi: GET /api/v1/courses?q=&category=&page=&size=
  CourseApi->>CourseService: findPublishedCourses(query)
  CourseService->>CourseRepo: Query PUBLISHED courses with pagination
  CourseRepo-->>CourseService: Page of courses
  CourseService-->>CourseApi: CourseSummaryResponse page
  CourseApi-->>Web: 200 OK with meta
  Web-->>Visitor: Render list or Vietnamese empty state
